}

### 4) PDF generatsiya (hujjat yaratilgach docId ni qo'ying)
@docId = <DOCUMENT_UUID>
GET {{host}}/api/document/v1/generate/{{docId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5) Talabnoma yaratish (NOTICE shablon avtomatik topiladi)
POST {{host}}/api/document/v1/notices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentId": "{{docId}}"
}
